#: main.cpp:28
msgid "Sweeper"
msgstr "Sweeper"

#: main.cpp:29
msgid "Helps clean unwanted traces the user leaves on the system."
msgstr "Pòmôgô czëszczëc niechcóné szlachë brëkòwnika òstówioné w systemie."

#: main.cpp:32
msgid "Original author"
msgstr "Pierszi ùsôdzca"

#: main.cpp:33
msgid "Maintainer"
msgstr "Òpiekùn"

#: main.cpp:34
msgid "Thumbnail Cache"
msgstr "Bùfora miniaturów"

#: privacyfunctions.cpp:50 privacyfunctions.cpp:59 privacyfunctions.cpp:68
msgid "A thumbnail could not be removed."
msgstr "Nie mòże rëmnąc miniaturczi."

#: privacyfunctions.cpp:132
msgid "The file exists but could not be removed."
msgstr "Lopk òbstoji leno nie mòżé òstac rëmniãti."

#: privacyfunctions.cpp:212
msgid "A favicon could not be removed."
msgstr "Ikòna favicon nie mòże òstac rëmniãtô."

#: rc.cpp:3 sweeper.cpp:43
msgid "Privacy Settings"
msgstr "Nastôwë priwatnosce"

#: rc.cpp:6
msgid "Network privacy level:"
msgstr "Równiô priwatnoscë sécë:"

#: rc.cpp:9
msgid "Low"
msgstr "Nisczi"

#: rc.cpp:12
msgid "Medium"
msgstr "Strzédny"

#: rc.cpp:15
msgid "High"
msgstr "Wësoczi"

#: rc.cpp:18
msgid "Custom"
msgstr "Swój"

#: rc.cpp:21
msgid "Financial Information"
msgstr "Financowô wëdowiédzô"

#: rc.cpp:24
msgid ""
"Warn me when I visit a site that uses my financial or purchase information:"
msgstr "Òstrzéżë przed próbą wëzwëskaniô Twòjëch financowëch pòdôwków:"

#: rc.cpp:27 rc.cpp:39
msgid "For marketing or advertising purposes"
msgstr "Dlô célów marketingù a reklamë"

#: rc.cpp:30 rc.cpp:42 rc.cpp:54
msgid "To share with other companies"
msgstr "Do wëmianë z jinëma firmama"

#: rc.cpp:33
msgid "Health Information"
msgstr "Wëdowiédzô ò zdrowim"

#: rc.cpp:36
msgid ""
"Warn me when I visit a site that uses my health or medical information: "
msgstr "Òstrzéżë przed próbą wëzwëskaniô Twòjëch lékarzczëch pòdôwków: "

#: rc.cpp:45
msgid "Demographics"
msgstr "Lëdztwò"

#: rc.cpp:48
msgid ""
"Warn me when I visit a site that uses my non-personally identifiable "
"information:"
msgstr "Òstrzéżë przed próbą wëzwëskaniô Twòjëch nieòsobistëch pòdôwków:"

#: rc.cpp:51
msgid "To determine my interests, habits or general behavior"
msgstr "Do òtaksowaniô zajimnotów, zwëków abò sprôwianiô sã"

#: rc.cpp:57
msgid ""
"Warn me when I visit a site that shares my personal information with other "
"companies"
msgstr ""
"Òstrzérzë mie przed òdwiedzanim serwera, chtëren wëmieniwô priwatne pòdôwczi "
"z jinëma firmama"

#: rc.cpp:60
msgid ""
"Warn me when I visit a site that does not let me know what information they "
"have about me"
msgstr ""
"Òstrzérzë mie przed òdwiedzanim serwera, chtëren zatacô wëdowiédzë ò "
"zbiéranëch priwatnëch pòdôwkach"

#: rc.cpp:63
msgid "Personal Information"
msgstr "Priwatne pòdôwczi"

#: rc.cpp:66
msgid ""
"Warn me when I visit a site that may contact me about other products or "
"services:"
msgstr ""
"Òstrzérzë mie przed òdwiedzanim serwera, chtëren przësélô wëdowiédzë ò "
"produktach czë ùsłëżnotach:"

#: rc.cpp:69
msgid "Warn me when I visit a site that may use my personal information to:"
msgstr ""
"Òstrzérzë mie przed òdwiedzanim serwera, chtëren wëzwëzskùjë priwatne "
"pòdôwczi do:"

#: rc.cpp:72
msgid "Determine my habits, interests or general behavior"
msgstr "Do òtaksowaniô zwëków, zajimnotów abò sprôwianiô sã"

#: rc.cpp:75
msgid "Via telephone"
msgstr "Przez telefón"

#: rc.cpp:78
msgid "Via mail"
msgstr "Pòcztą"

#: rc.cpp:81
msgid "Via email"
msgstr "Przez e-mailã"

#: rc.cpp:84
msgid "And do not allow me to remove my contact information"
msgstr "Ë nie zezwòlô na rëmanié Twòjëch kòntaktowëch pòdôwków"

#: rc.cpp:87
msgid "Form1"
msgstr "Form1"

#: rc.cpp:90
msgid "Select &All"
msgstr "Wëbiérzë &wszëtkò"

#: rc.cpp:93
msgid "Alt+A"
msgstr "Alt+A"

#: rc.cpp:96
msgid "Select &None"
msgstr "Ò&dznaczë wszëtkò"

#: rc.cpp:99
msgid "Alt+N"
msgstr "Alt+N"

#: rc.cpp:102
msgid "&Clean Up"
msgstr "Wë&czëszczë"

#: rc.cpp:105
msgid "Alt+C"
msgstr "Alt+C"

#: rc.cpp:106
msgctxt "NAME OF TRANSLATORS"
msgid "Your names"
msgstr "Mark Kwidzińsczi, Michôł Òstrowsczi"

#: rc.cpp:107
msgctxt "EMAIL OF TRANSLATORS"
msgid "Your emails"
msgstr "mark@linuxcsb.org, michol@linuxcsb.org"

#: sweeper.cpp:44
msgid "Description"
msgstr "Òpisënk"

#: sweeper.cpp:54
msgid "General"
msgstr "Òglowi"

#: sweeper.cpp:55
msgid "Web Browsing"
msgstr "Przezéranié séce"

#: sweeper.cpp:60
msgid ""
"Check all cleanup actions you would like to perform. These will be executed "
"by pressing the button below"
msgstr ""
"Wëbierzë elementë do wëczëszczëniô. Òstaną òne wëczëszczone pò wcësniãcym "
"knąpë niżi"

#: sweeper.cpp:61
msgid "Immediately performs the cleanup actions selected above"
msgstr "Zarôzkù zrëszë wëbróne òperacëje czëszczëniô"

#: sweeper.cpp:142
msgid ""
"You are deleting data that is potentially valuable to you. Are you sure?"
msgstr "Na gwës rëmac wëbróne pòdôwczi?"

#: sweeper.cpp:147
msgid "Starting cleanup..."
msgstr "Je napòczãté czëszczënié..."

#: sweeper.cpp:153
#, qt-format
msgid "Clearing %1..."
msgstr "Czëszczënié %1..."

#: sweeper.cpp:158
#, qt-format
msgid "Clearing of %1 failed: %2"
msgstr "Czëszczënié %1 nie darzëłô sã: %2"

#: sweeper.cpp:164
msgid "Clean up finished."
msgstr "Czëszczënié zakùńczoné."

